          "review": "The complete imageA value is affine in spatial w with slope -4*m*a and intercept 8*m^2*a^2+4*m*a*z. The polynomial identity is function equality before passing through iteratedDeriv and applying the affine derivative theorem. It is valid for every real index m and holds a,z,T fixed; no real-index exponent-positivity claim is introduced.",
